    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black font-serif-brand mt-1">About Muchea Stockfeed & Hardware</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-stone-300 mt-2 max-w-2xl">
      Rooted in Western Australia's agricultural crossroads. We are dedicated to providing horse lovers, livestock breeders, hobby farmers, and rural fencing contractors with genuine expert service, fair pricing, and dependable supply.
    </p>
