    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-serif-brand text-bush-900">Proudly West Australian, Proudly Muchea</h2>
    <p>
      Located on the Great Northern Highway at the vital junction of the Chittering Valley, Brand Highway, and Perth northern corridor, <strong>Muchea Stockfeed & Hardware</strong> was established to bridge the gap between heavy agricultural supply and local retail animal care.
    </p>
    <p>
      Unlike urban pet shops, our warehouse is built for real country work. From 20kg bags of Hygain, Mitavite, and steam-rolled grains, to prime export oaten round bales, cyclone wire, heavy bitumen star pickets, and rural poly pipe fittings — if it belongs on a Western Australian farm or horse property, we stock it.
    </p>
  </div>

